      "writtenOn": "2022-12-22T20:56:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right. It was required for a corner case. While turning on, updateBatchScanToRegularScanClients() calls flush and stop API. The flushed scan results could come later than when the batched scan client is cleared. So, this change is to make sure the flushed results were received in handleFlushBatchResults().\n\nupdateBatchScanToRegularScanClients() {\n   handleFlushBatchResults(client);  // flushed results come asynchronously\n   handleStopScan(client); // it can clear batch scan client before receiving the flushed scan results\n   ...\n}",
