      "writtenOn": "2022-12-22T18:34:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What does it mean? App has to set both? If yes, why not just rename CALLBACK_TYPE_AUTO_BATCH to something like CALLBACK_TYPE_ALL_MATCH_AUTO_BATCH TO  reflect that fact? Or simply mention that it will be all match in the javadoc and let app just set CALLBACK_TYPE_AUTO_BATCH?",
