      "writtenOn": "2022-12-22T20:56:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Callback types have been used as bit mask like (CALLBACK_TYPE_FIRST_MATCH | CALLBACK_TYPE_MATCH_LOST). Internally, the auto batch scan client will work like CALLBACK_TYPE_ALL_MATCHES during regular scan or batch scan, but CALLBACK_TYPE_AUTO_BATCH is just a flag to indicate app wants the auto switching. I can add comments in javadoc like CALLBACK_TYPE_AUTO_BATCH should be used with CALLBACK_TYPE_ALL_MATCHES.\n\nIn meanwhile, realized I need to update ScanSettingsTest.java as well.",
      "parentUuid": "c58d4a78_3bee03f7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 346,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 346,
        "endChar": 92
      },
